  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into wedges and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862d578e8ca7af41fae557-04c9ff82.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse kidney beans.\n• Grate carrot. Thinly slice spring onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862d578e8ca7af41fae557-1b30ac5b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When wedges have 10 mins remaining, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook corn, kidney beans and carrot until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add BBQ spice blend, tomato paste and garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the water and stock powder and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir in the butter and BBQ sauce until well combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862d578e8ca7af41fae557-1fb1aab4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide wedges between plates. Top with buffalo kidney beans. Drizzle with sriracha. Garnish with spring onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66862d578e8ca7af41fae557-ae951bf6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
